---
// src/components/sections/PhysicalInputSection.astro
---

<section class="physical-input">
  <div class="physical-input__header">
    <p>V1 / Entrada física</p>
    <p>Suelo → Sensor → ESP32</p>
  </div>

  <div class="physical-input__content">
    <div class="physical-input__intro">
      <h2>La tierra es el origen del dato.</h2>

      <p>
        Antes de interpretar porcentajes o estados, necesitamos capturar una
        condición física real del suelo.
      </p>
    </div>

    <ol class="physical-input__steps">
      <li>
        <span>01</span>

        <div>
          <p>Condición física</p>
          <p>Humedad presente en la tierra.</p>
        </div>
      </li>

      <li>
        <span>02</span>

        <div>
          <p>Captura</p>
          <p>Sensor capacitivo de humedad.</p>
        </div>
      </li>

      <li>
        <span>03</span>

        <div>
          <p>Lectura</p>
          <p>Entrada analógica del ESP32.</p>
        </div>
      </li>
    </ol>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .physical-input {
    min-height: calc(100svh - (var(--page-gutter) * 2));
    margin: var(--page-gutter);
    padding: 1.25rem;

    overflow: clip;
    border-radius: var(--section-radius);

    background: var(--color-ochre-bg);
    color: var(--color-ochre);
  }

  .physical-input__header {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 2rem;
  }

  .physical-input__header p {
    margin: 0;

    font-size: 0.6875rem;
    line-height: 1;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .physical-input__content {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) minmax(20rem, 1fr);
    align-items: end;
    gap: 4rem;

    margin-top: 6rem;
  }

  .physical-input__intro h2 {
    max-width: 9ch;
    margin: 0;

    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: clamp(4rem, 8vw, 8rem);
    font-weight: 400;
    line-height: 0.88;
    letter-spacing: -0.04em;
  }

  .physical-input__intro > p {
    max-width: 28rem;
    margin: 2rem 0 0;

    font-size: 0.875rem;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }

  .physical-input__steps {
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;

    border-top: 1px dashed currentColor;

    list-style: none;
  }

  .physical-input__steps li {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 3rem 1fr;
    gap: 1rem;

    padding: 1.25rem 0;

    border-bottom: 1px dashed currentColor;
  }

  .physical-input__steps span {
    font-size: 0.6875rem;
    line-height: 1;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
  }

  .physical-input__steps div p:first-child {
    margin: 0;

    font-size: 1.125rem;
    line-height: 1;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
  }

  .physical-input__steps div p:last-child {
    max-width: 24rem;
    margin: 0.75rem 0 0;

    font-size: 0.8125rem;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }

  @media (max-width: 48rem) {
    .physical-input {
      padding: 1rem;
    }

    .physical-input__header {
      gap: 1rem;
    }

    .physical-input__content {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 3rem;

      margin-top: 5rem;
    }

    .physical-input__intro h2 {
      max-width: 8ch;
      font-size: clamp(3.75rem, 17vw, 6rem);
    }

    .physical-input__steps li {
      grid-template-columns: 2.5rem 1fr;
    }
  }
</style>
